      "created_at": "2015-07-27T04:52:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After counting several times, I recently discovered that I'm missing a card from my Captain Cosmic deck. Now I know I can buy a replacement card, but I have no idea WHICH card it is...</p><p>I'm going to go through the cardlist and the number of that card that I have. If someone could do me the favor of double checking their own deck and tell me which one I'm missing, I'd be greatly appreciative. :)</p><p>Captain Cosmic character card- 1(Pretty sure it's not this one)</p><p>Augmented Ally- 3</p><p>Autonomous Blade- 2 (Almost positive it's this one, but I want to be sure...)</p><p>Conservation of Energy- 2</p><p>Construct Cataclysm- 2</p><p>Cosmic Crest- 2</p><p>Cosmic Weapon- 3</p><p>Destructive Response- 2</p><p>Dynamic Siphon- 3</p><p>Energy Bracer- 3</p><p>Harsh Offense- 3</p><p>Potent&nbsp; Destruction- 3</p><p>Sustained Influence- 3</p><p>Unflagging Animation- 2</p><p>Vitality Conduit- 3</p><p>Wounding Buffer- 3</p><p>After sorting and counting them all out, I'm fairly positive that I'm missing an Autonomous Blade since there's three of every other construct card excluding Cosmic Crest(but from what I remember he only has two of those to begin with). But if someone could just double check for me, I'd be very happy.</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p><p>Edited: OCD hit, alphabatized cards.</p>",
